{"id":"c33d10790a9d2114","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/14_构造子标签.md","title":"固定构造子与编码约定","display":"固定构造子与编码约定","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","encoding"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>encoding</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<p>每个构造子代码是 Kuratowski 对“标签、载荷”。零元载荷为空集；一元载荷是子对象本身；至少二元载荷为右嵌套有序对。有限实参<strong>列</strong>自身则是自然数定义域的函数图。变量、公式、类型、证明、值、状态在元理论中全是集合，不另加元语言类型。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">标签</th>\n<th>构造子</th>\n<th>载荷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a></td>\n<td>自然数原子名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a></td>\n<td>公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a></td>\n<td>两个公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d00664d192427d28\" href=\"?note=d00664d192427d28\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PBox\">PBox</a></td>\n<td>公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a></td>\n<td>两个公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">6</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_POr\">POr</a></td>\n<td>两个公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" href=\"?note=6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_PTop\">PTop</a></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">20</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b30f1eee99e1c728\" href=\"?note=b30f1eee99e1c728\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_TBase\">TBase</a></td>\n<td>基类型标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">21</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a></td>\n<td>定义域类型、陪域类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">30</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a></td>\n<td>项指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">31</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a></td>\n<td>类型注解、项体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">32</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a></td>\n<td>函数项、实参项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">33</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"ce774aac70609584\" href=\"?note=ce774aac70609584\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_TConst\">TConst</a></td>\n<td>常项名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">34</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></td>\n<td>无类型项体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">40</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"c6f16aed01caed9d\" href=\"?note=c6f16aed01caed9d\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_OK\">OK</a></td>\n<td>结果类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">41</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"57b7305c7f765988\" href=\"?note=57b7305c7f765988\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_Fail\">Fail</a></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">50</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"e67edc6c28bf5962\" href=\"?note=e67edc6c28bf5962\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FVar\">FVar</a></td>\n<td>个体变量名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">51</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FFun\">FFun</a></td>\n<td>符号、有限实参列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">52</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"372f265dbb09b97a\" href=\"?note=372f265dbb09b97a\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FRel\">FRel</a></td>\n<td>符号、有限实参列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">53</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" href=\"?note=f6a39a2c0a4c17e7\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FEq\">FEq</a></td>\n<td>两个项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">54</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a></td>\n<td>个体变量名、公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">55</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"b10bd78951872ea5\" href=\"?note=b10bd78951872ea5\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_SRelVar\">SRelVar</a></td>\n<td>元数、关系名字、有限实参列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">56</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"aa9c9cb978b3cbf4\" href=\"?note=aa9c9cb978b3cbf4\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_SAll\">SAll</a></td>\n<td>元数、关系名字、公式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">57</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"5fc187922d1b1881\" href=\"?note=5fc187922d1b1881\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FTV\">FTV</a></td>\n<td>类型指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">58</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"b4002d1847fb33d0\" href=\"?note=b4002d1847fb33d0\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FForall\">FForall</a></td>\n<td>类型体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">59</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"1b540c729aaa0e46\" href=\"?note=1b540c729aaa0e46\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FTAbs\">FTAbs</a></td>\n<td>项体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">60</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"acb0218f5d2e90af\" href=\"?note=acb0218f5d2e90af\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FTInst\">FTInst</a></td>\n<td>项、类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">61</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-29\" data-note=\"fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" href=\"?note=fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_NVar\">NVar</a></td>\n<td>命名项变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">62</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-30\" data-note=\"d7c6583016ee6af4\" href=\"?note=d7c6583016ee6af4\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_NLam\">NLam</a></td>\n<td>名字、项体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">63</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-31\" data-note=\"3cff538dd049d418\" href=\"?note=3cff538dd049d418\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_NApp\">NApp</a></td>\n<td>两个命名项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">64</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-32\" data-note=\"b0bad47202596d03\" href=\"?note=b0bad47202596d03\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_CMeta\">CMeta</a></td>\n<td>类型元变量名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">70</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-33\" data-note=\"59a386a959a99335\" href=\"?note=59a386a959a99335\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_CombK\">CombK</a></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">71</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-34\" data-note=\"6940244b87569fc3\" href=\"?note=6940244b87569fc3\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_CombS\">CombS</a></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">75</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-35\" data-note=\"d5cc2a4ed5b3afc4\" href=\"?note=d5cc2a4ed5b3afc4\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_NHole\">NHole</a></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">77</td>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-36\" data-note=\"75c3ccf26c7ae96b\" href=\"?note=75c3ccf26c7ae96b\" title=\"规范公式/ZFC_FNamelessAll\">FNamelessAll</a></td>\n<td>消去绑定名后的编码体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>同一个箭头标签用于不同对象类型语言，但形成谓词分别约束其子节点。名称相同不意味着形成规则相同。算法结果 OK/Fail 的标签不等于命题真值或 L3 的自然数真值。</p>\n<p>有限推导表里用于打包一行的元组不添加这个语法标签；其固定字段顺序写在 XRow 定义中。不得用 Python 列表/元组的运行时身份充当规范集合编码。</p>\n","headings":[],"links":[{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PAtom","status":"resolved","id":"30627acf823af3c5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PNeg","status":"resolved","id":"1ee75039aeffe56b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PNeg|PNeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PImp","status":"resolved","id":"88931f785a07870f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PImp|PImp]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PBot","status":"resolved","id":"8839a547e393d0af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PBot|PBot]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PBox","status":"resolved","id":"d00664d192427d28","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PBox|PBox]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PAnd","status":"resolved","id":"635d3a0d1ddc63d5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_POr","status":"resolved","id":"892530c42a605aab","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_POr|POr]]","embed":false},{"target":"规范公式/ZFC_PTop","status":"resolved","id":"6d2e5f9b8bceac9f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"","excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZF